    {"id":"s06","type":"verse","speaker":"minister","voice":"clara","participation":{"lecta":{"gradus":1,"source":"DMS 31 a"},"cantu":{"gradus":1,"source":"DMS 25 a"}},"w":[{"i":"w011","f":"Amen","l":"amen","p":".","m":46}]},
    {"id":"s05","type":"rubric","text":"In Missa pontificali ter benedicitur, ut in Pontificali habetur. In Missis in quibus dictum est Benedicámus Dómino vel Requiéscant in pace, non datur benedictio, sed dicto Pláceat et osculato altari, celebrans legit, si dicendum sit, Evangelium S. Ioannis.","an":8}
